# Nutrition Module Configuration

# USDA FoodData Central API Key
# Get a free key at: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
# Required for food name/text search
# Optional for barcode lookup (uses Open Food Facts instead)
VITE_FDC_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: Copy this file to .env and add your actual API key
# The .env file is git-ignored to keep your key private
